WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.485 --> 00:00:12.986
was bouncing to Kids Central.

2
00:00:14.527 --> 00:00:17.609
"Gurp, gurp, gurp," she croaked.

3
00:00:18.789 --> 00:00:21.051
She was thinking about her pet frog, Gurpy.

4
00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:22.932
He was at the vet today.

5
00:00:29.748 --> 00:00:32.551
Miss Shelly blew her whistle as Izzie walked in the gym.

6
00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:34.913
"Time to go outside!"

7
00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:36.234
the teacher called.

8
00:00:41.438 --> 00:00:44.340
we're going to play hopscotch," Miss Shelly said.

9
00:00:45.441 --> 00:00:47.943
She had drawn a hopscotch board on the blacktop.

10
00:00:48.684 --> 00:00:50.185
Izzie bounced up and down.

11
00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:53.248
"We're going to hop, just like Gurpy!"

12
00:00:54.629 --> 00:00:57.832
"We're going to do more than just hop," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:01.581
"This is a special game of hopscotch.

14
00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:05.523
You will all write an activity in each square.

15
00:01:06.603 --> 00:01:09.624
When you land in a square, you have to do that activity."

16
00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.366
"What kind of activities should we write?"

17
00:01:13.726 --> 00:01:14.486
Nina asked.

18
00:01:14.506 --> 00:01:17.928
"Something fun," Miss Shelly said.

19
00:01:17.948 --> 00:01:20.529
"Like ten jumping jacks!"

20
00:01:22.029 --> 00:01:23.470
"Or five push-ups?"

21
00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:24.710
Bobby asked.

22
00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:27.331
"Or spin around eight times?"

23
00:01:27.732 --> 00:01:28.512
Jason asked.

24
00:01:29.584 --> 00:01:31.545
"Exactly!" Miss Shelly said.

25
00:01:31.565 --> 00:01:35.427
"Grab a piece of chalk and fill in the blank squares."

26
00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.551
Izzie knew exactly what to write.

27
00:01:44.092 --> 00:01:47.414
When everyone was finished, they lined up behind Miss Shelly.

28
00:01:48.595 --> 00:01:50.216
Miss Shelly held up a beanbag.

29
00:01:50.236 --> 00:01:54.238
"To start, toss this beanbag onto a square.

30
00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:57.120
Hop to the square on one foot.

31
00:01:58.212 --> 00:01:59.933
If you hop on a line, you are out!

32
00:02:01.534 --> 00:02:03.674
When you get to the square, do the activity.

33
00:02:04.615 --> 00:02:07.116
If you can't do the activity, you're out."

34
00:02:07.136 --> 00:02:09.717
"I'll go first!"

35
00:02:10.197 --> 00:02:11.158
Izzie blurted out.

36
00:02:13.919 --> 00:02:15.259
Izzie tossed the beanbag.

37
00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.641
She hopped to where it landed.

38
00:02:18.661 --> 00:02:21.962
"Six push-ups," she read.

39
00:02:21.982 --> 00:02:24.983
"That's mine!"

40
00:02:25.023 --> 00:02:26.204
Bobby said proudly.

41
00:02:27.756 --> 00:02:33.299
"One, two, three, four, five, six."

42
00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.741
Everyone counted as Izzie did her push-ups.

43
00:02:36.761 --> 00:02:40.003
"Yay!" Nina cheered.

44
00:02:40.683 --> 00:02:41.504
She was next.

45
00:02:42.664 --> 00:02:43.885
She hopped to her square.

46
00:02:43.905 --> 00:02:47.987
"Five frog jumps?

47
00:02:48.988 --> 00:02:50.869
This must be yours, Izzie.

48
00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.030
What's a frog jump?"

49
00:02:54.631 --> 00:02:55.472
Izzie giggled.

50
00:02:56.512 --> 00:02:58.213
"It's when you jump like Gurpy!"

51
00:02:59.193 --> 00:03:01.874
She squatted down and then jumped and moved forward.

52
00:03:01.894 --> 00:03:03.354
"Like this!"

53
00:03:04.594 --> 00:03:06.015
Nina's face turned red.

54
00:03:06.035 --> 00:03:08.155
"Do I have to?"

55
00:03:08.635 --> 00:03:09.856
She turned to Miss Shelly.

56
00:03:10.996 --> 00:03:11.976
Miss Shelly nodded.

57
00:03:11.996 --> 00:03:14.097
"It's part of the game."

58
00:03:14.117 --> 00:03:17.458
"Otherwise you'll be out," Ethan said.

59
00:03:17.478 --> 00:03:23.119
"When you do them, it brings good luck for frogs," Izzie said.

60
00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.248
Everyone looked at Izzie.

61
00:03:26.268 --> 00:03:27.869
"Really?" asked Jason.

62
00:03:27.889 --> 00:03:30.970
"I think so," Izzie answered.

63
00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:34.611
Nina sighed and did five little frog jumps.

64
00:03:34.631 --> 00:03:40.094
"Yay! Those were perfect frog jumps!"

65
00:03:40.194 --> 00:03:40.954
Izzie cheered.

66
00:03:42.075 --> 00:03:42.995
Ethan was next.

67
00:03:44.055 --> 00:03:45.376
He had to do a cartwheel.

68
00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:48.157
Bobby spun around ten times.

69
00:03:50.558 --> 00:03:52.599
Jason did the crabwalk for one minute.

70
00:03:53.639 --> 00:03:55.180
Then they all took another turn.

71
00:03:56.260 --> 00:03:58.141
Soon it was time to go back inside.

72
00:04:01.984 --> 00:04:03.025
is Gurpy doing?"

73
00:04:03.425 --> 00:04:04.426
Miss Shelly asked.

74
00:04:05.647 --> 00:04:06.547
Izzie looked down.

75
00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:08.409
"He's at the vet.

76
00:04:09.549 --> 00:04:11.531
He wasn't eating," she said.

77
00:04:11.551 --> 00:04:14.553
"Oh, Izzie, I'm sorry.

78
00:04:14.573 --> 00:04:18.035
I hope he's okay," Miss Shelly said.

79
00:04:19.136 --> 00:04:19.876
Izzie nodded.

80
00:04:19.896 --> 00:04:21.578
"Me too."

81
00:04:22.698 --> 00:04:24.680
Just then Izzie's mom arrived.

82
00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.773
"Mom!" Izzie called.

83
00:04:27.793 --> 00:04:30.394
"Good news, sweetie.

84
00:04:31.234 --> 00:04:33.115
Gurpy ate five worms today.

85
00:04:34.215 --> 00:04:35.596
Everything is okay!"

86
00:04:35.976 --> 00:04:37.176
her mom said happily.

87
00:04:38.297 --> 00:04:40.138
Izzie jumped up and hugged Nina.

88
00:04:41.958 --> 00:04:43.939
"I knew those frog jumps would work!

89
00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:45.940
Thanks, Nina."
